  message: "Dogfooding re-confirmed (blinded severity 4/5): the lit `reactive_property` framework pattern (bare `^property$` decorator matcher, no language gate) fires on 31 Python builtin `@property` getters in self-analysis (SliceResult.feature_id, DiResolver getters, etc.). lit's other concepts (component/render_method/lifecycle_hook) correctly target TS — only the bare `property` matcher leaks cross-language. Same language-gate fix this item already tracks. [dogfood]"  # 3da6
