- op: discuss  # 1e36
  at: '2026-07-01T14:23:37Z'  # 1e36
  by: agent  # 1e36
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1e36
  clock: 4  # 1e36
  nonce: '1e36'  # 1e36
  message: "Fixed in PR (dev 6da5a7cd38), Wave-3 Phase-2 §C linker F3. Root cause: framework-pattern matcher consults only per-pattern language filter, never the file-level FrameworkPatternDef.language, so lit.yaml's 'language: javascript' was inert and reactive_property (decorator '^property$') fired on Python's builtin @property (@state/@query ungated too). Fix: gate the 3 common-word decorator patterns (reactive_property/internal_state/dom_query-query) on language '^(javascript|typescript)$'; camelCase Lit decorators (queryAll/queryAsync/eventOptions/customElement) are ecosystem-unique, no gate. Global file-level gate across 107 YAMLs remains deferred (multi/list/comment-suffixed forms). Behavioral evidence (editable binary, re-ran filed match_patterns repro on merged dev): python @property vs lit reactive_property = [] (was [reactive_property]); js @property vs lit = [reactive_property] (positive control intact). Production-path tests: test_framework_patterns.py::TestFrameworkPatternEcosystemGating (lit cases). 861 framework_patterns tests pass, 100% coverage."  # 1e36
